    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "C76E70C6C35914B0",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n欢迎来到冰柜道馆。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C76E71C6C3591663",
      "text": "深情灵魂饶舌乐莱姆……\\n要挑战这个道馆馆主吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C76E72C6C3591816",
      "text": "那好，我带你去对战场吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C76E73C6C35919C9",
      "text": "等你准备好了，\\n随时都可以告诉我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_nobattle",
      "hash64": "D0A496BAB24C009D",
      "text": "至少需要有２只能对战的宝可梦\\n才能挑战莱姆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_00",
      "hash64": "F4F1D404F7C6E265",
      "text": "YO、YO……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CDB670A9B4004749",
      "text": "……从对战场上传来了\\n节奏感很强的说话声！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_01",
      "hash64": "F4F1D304F7C6E0B2",
      "text": "说唱对战咱比一比！我今天就是要打赢你♪\\nYO朋友！与其被我摆平！不如自己躺平♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_02",
      "hash64": "F4F1D204F7C6DEFF",
      "text": "竖起耳朵听我说唱道馆馆主♪\\n我是店里打工帮的带头帮主♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_02",
      "hash64": "CDB66DA9B4004230",
      "text": "咚咚锵……\\n咚咚锵……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "1436B0F9B1C26717",
      "text": "好个店里打工的带头帮主♪\\n跟莱姆比也就是初出茅庐♪\\r\\n你聪明的话赶紧打道回府♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "1436B1F9B1C268CA",
      "text": "我的名字是莱姆♪对谁都会很粗鲁♪\\n人见人喊不不不♪就像见了炸药库♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "1436B2F9B1C26A7D",
      "text": "皮毛的功夫别来秀♪\\n说唱哪能一蹴而就♪HEY！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_03",
      "hash64": "CDB66EA9B40043E3",
      "text": "咚咚锵……\\n咚咚锵……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_03",
      "hash64": "F4F1D104F7C6DD4C",
      "text": "完败，惨败，你送了我场溃败！\\n下次一定挽回颜面，雪耻就在下午３点～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "1436ABF9B1C25E98",
      "text": "等等！接着来啊！\\c\\n啊……说啥？下午３点？\\n你这股激情也太放飞自我了吧！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "1436ACF9B1C2604B",
      "text": "早早放弃，定是碰壁！\\n谁有骨气，快来找ME！ME～N！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "1436ADF9B1C261FE",
      "text": "……嗯？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "1436AEF9B1C263B1",
      "text": "下一个对手是做了开场表演的你？\\n道馆对战？还是说唱对战？要比哪个？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0E65523F48A7AD8E",
      "text": "道馆对战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0E65513F48A7ABDB",
      "text": "说唱对战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "1436A7F9B1C257CC",
      "text": "不可能是说唱！\\n一点都没错！HAHAHA！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "1436A8F9B1C2597F",
      "text": "HAHA！你的回答真是搞笑！\\n逗得让我睡不好觉！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "143A35F9B1C57EED",
      "text": "……嗯？你说我的说话方式\\n听起来很奇妙吗？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "143A34F9B1C57D3A",
      "text": "这是说唱！\\c\\n是以不断押韵的句子\\n谱写而成的灵魂之歌！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "143A33F9B1C57B87",
      "text": "勾魂眼，跟随俺，刚一出发就打闪♪\\n很习惯，不稀罕，然后成了家常饭♪\\r\\n……就是这种感觉！理解了吗？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "143A32F9B1C579D4",
      "text": "哎，你是个宝可梦训练家！\\n在对战中展现出你那颗亢奋的心吧！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "143A31F9B1C57821",
      "text": "虽然我也是把说唱当成正业，\\n但如果让我用幽灵宝可梦对战的话，\\r\\n基本没人能比得上我哦。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "143A30F9B1C5766E",
      "text": "我是莱姆！\\nａ．ｋ．ａ深情灵魂饶舌乐！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_16",
      "hash64": "143A2FF9B1C574BB",
      "text": "势如强弩！\\n灵与命！对战场上把你虐！！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_17",
      "hash64": "143A2EF9B1C57308",
      "text": "HAHAHA！好啊～！\\n我深深地感受到了你的灵魂！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_18",
      "hash64": "143A2DF9B1C57155",
      "text": "能让我叫出声来，说明你很有骨气！\\n哼！道馆徽章拿去吧！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_19",
      "hash64": "143A2CF9B1C56FA2",
      "text": "顺便也给你个能在头等席\\n听我演出的权利怎么样？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_badge",
      "hash64": "0D82A4DAAE6440AF",
      "text": "有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]个道馆徽章的话，\\n等级[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的宝可梦会更容易捉到，\\r\\n而且它们都会听你的话哦！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_badge_all",
      "hash64": "6C44FEFFDFD72743",
      "text": "有８个道馆徽章的话，\\n不管是什么样的宝可梦都能捉到，\\r\\n而且它们都会老老实实地听你的话哦！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_waza",
      "hash64": "A108F704076F9DE5",
      "text": "说唱让我很兴奋，心情好得很！\\n再送你一个礼物吧！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
